WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.600
Sharing your screen…
with a password note open?

2
00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:04.950
Shh.

3
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:07.000
Hushpad.
A quiet notepad for private notes.

4
00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:12.400
There's no Save button.
It saves as you type.

5
00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:15.900
On disk, every note is AES-256 encrypted.

6
00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:21.200
You can see it on your screen,

7
00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:26.900
but on Windows,
screenshots and screen shares can't.

8
00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:31.400
Secret notes open hidden. Click to reveal.

9
00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:34.900
Copy it,
and the clipboard clears in 30 seconds.

10
00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:39.400
Ctrl+C copies it with the formatting.

11
00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:42.900
Just the text? Ctrl+Shift+C.

12
00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:47.400
Paste HTML or JSON into a code note.

13
00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:50.900
One-line JSON? Ctrl+Alt+J tidies it up.

14
00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:56.400
Drag over an area,
and the shot lands in your note.

15
00:00:56.400 --> 00:00:59.900
Short screen recordings work too,
up to 3 minutes.

16
00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:06.000
Ctrl+Alt+M saves whatever's
on your clipboard as a note.

17
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:09.900
Looking for something? Ctrl+K.

18
00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:14.000
Write quietly. Seen by no one.

19
00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:16.500
Free and open source,
for Windows and macOS.

20
00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:19.000
gdra.mycafe24.com/hushpad
